90/extras/71b0f7dc85aad2d54f61a074ff7af07b.mp4?t=1787302418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of Detective B, a private detective for Soul City, completely controlled by the mega-corporation Trinity Inc., in order to solve a wide array of incidents occurring.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ah, and you know Hikikomori, yes? Well, the main character, B, is one of those, absolutely refusing to leave her home.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928190/extras/c4b5a3a8406be0186d9fadf5cb71110e.avif?t=1787302418\" width=1560 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928190/extras/d36797648fdb5324e7471cace16d38be.poster.avif?t=1787302418\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928190/extras/d36797648fdb5324e7471cace16d38be.webm?t=1787302418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928190/extras/d36797648fdb5324e7471cace16d38be.mp4?t=1787302418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put all sorts of future technological innovations to use in order to find the clues hidden at the scenes of the crime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928190/extras/124963c0b462a16ab282b0c0f63b1cf7.avif?t=1787302418\" width=1560 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928190/extras/6e7554ce10cfeed3ec47ad4150d3f9c4.poster.avif?t=1787302418\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928190/extras/6e7554ce10cfeed3ec47ad4150d3f9c4.webm?t=1787302418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928190/extras/6e7554ce10cfeed3ec47ad4150d3f9c4.mp4?t=1787302418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skim away the lies, piece together the facts, and discover the truth hidden within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928190/extras/8881f192e96bb58c51b76a6079e9def3.avif?t=1787302418\" width=1560 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928190/extras/aa093ff687967a088052062cb562b456.poster.avif?t=1787302418\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928190/extras/aa093ff687967a088052062cb562b456.webm?t=1787302418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928190/extras/aa093ff687967a088052062cb562b456.mp4?t=1787302418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your perpetrators won't just turn themselves in.  <br>BREAK through their lies to uncover the truths they're trying to hide!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamsta